---
title:    "Teaching Functional and Logic Programming with a Single Computation Model"
citation: "(PLILP 1997)"
url:      "https://www.michaelhanus.de/papers/DPLE97.html"
date:     1997-01-01 # used for sorting, most recent first, should usually match the papers date
---
This paper describes how to use Curry to teach functional and
logic programming paradigms in a single course based on Curry's computation model.